Package: pdacTranscriptomicAtlas
Type: Project
Title: Composition Identifiability in Public PDAC Transcriptomics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(person("Ricardo", "Romero", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Reproducible cross-cohort re-analysis of public pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma transcriptomic datasets, with explicit metadata audit, random-effects meta-analysis, composition-sensitivity analysis, TCGA/GTEx validation, single-cell localization, pan-cancer specificity testing, PurIST subtyping, and CIBERSORTx reference-based validation.
